{"id":"P047-1","subject":"P","unit":"P047","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P047-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n50Hz, 극수가 4인 유도 전동기의 전부하일 때 회전속도\n\n가 1200rpm이다. 회전속도를 1050rpm으로 하기 위해\n\n필요한 외부저항은 몇 Ω인가?\n\n(단, 2차측 한 상의 저항은 3Ω이고 Y결선 되어있다.)\n\n\n① 1.2          ② 1.5\n\n③ 3.6          ④ 4.8\n\n⑤ 5.2","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1206}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n직류 전동기의 전압제어에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 정출력 제어이다.\n\n② 워드레오나드 방식일 경우, 직류 보조 발전기와 직류\n\n  보조 전동기를 사용한다.\n\n③ 일그너 방식일 경우, 플라이 휠을 채용한다.\n\n④ 속도와 전압을 광범위하게 조절할 수 있다.\n\n⑤ 설치 비용이 비싸다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":564},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":137},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m02-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1139}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n 기기의 온도시험을 하는 방법으로 동일정격의 두 대의\n\n 직류기를 기계적으로 직결하여 하나는 발전기, 하나는\n\n 전동기로 운전하여 발전기가 발생한 전력을 전동기에\n\n 공급하고 전동기가 발생한 기계력을 발전기의 축에\n\n 반환하여 두 기기의 손실만을 외부에서 공급하는 방법\n\n  으로, 두 기기의 전 손실을 전기적으로 공급하는 방법을\n\n    (      )이라 한다.\n\n\n① 홉킨스법       ② 카프법\n\n③ 블론델법       ④ 실부하법\n\n⑤ 프로니브레이크법","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":613},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":745}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n3상 변압기의 특징으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 사용 철심의 양이 감소하여 철손이 감소하므로 효율이\n\n  좋다.\n\n② 1상의 고장시, 2상으로 3상 전력을 공급할 수 있다.\n\n③ Y, △결선을 변압기 외함 내에서 하므로 부싱이 절약\n\n  된다.\n\n④ 예비기로 사용하기에는 부적당하다.\n\n⑤ 설치면적이 감소된다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1515}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n동기 임피던스가 커질 때, 전압변동률과 동기화력은 어떻\n\n게 되는가?\n\n\n① 전압변동률 감소, 동기화력 증가\n\n② 전압변동률 감소, 동기화력 감소\n\n③ 전압변동률 증가, 동기화력 증가\n\n④ 전압변동률 증가, 동기화력 감소\n\n⑤ 전압변동률 일정, 동기화력 일정","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":367},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m05-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1578}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n동기 임피던스가 2Ω인 두 대의 동기 발전기를 병렬로\n\n운전할 때, 두 발전기간의 기전력차가 150V였다.\n\n이 경우에 흐르는 순환전류는 몇 A인가?\n\n\n① 28.5         ② 37.5\n\n③ 42.5         ④ 47.5\n\n⑤ 72.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":670},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":306}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n변압기의 철심이 갖추어야 할 구비조건이 아닌 것은?\n\n\n① 비투자율이 작아야 한다.\n\n② 저항률이 커야한다.\n\n③ 히스테리시스계수가 작아야 한다.\n\n④ 규소함유량을 4~4.5 정도로 한다.\n\n⑤ 성층철심을 사용한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":668}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n유도 발전기에 대한 내용으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 난조가 발생하지 않는다.\n\n② 구조가 복잡하고 기동이 어렵다.\n\n③ 동기 발전기보다 가격이 저렴하다.\n\n④ 역률과 효율이 낮다.\n\n⑤ 단락전류가 작고 지속시간이 짧다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1214}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n200V, 50Hz, 6극, 6.3kW의 3상 유도전동기의 회\n\n전속도가 900rpm일 때, 2차 동손은 몇 W인가?\n\n\n① 350         ② 700\n\n③ 1400         ④ 1800\n\n⑤ 2100","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":919}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n다음 중 4단자 사이리스터는?\n\n\n① SSS          ② SCS\n\n③ GTO         ④ SCR\n\n⑤ Diode","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m10-q.webp","width":678,"height":315},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":963},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m10-e2.webp","width":678,"height":940}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n내부저항이 0.5Ω, 기전력이 1V인 전지 3개를 직렬연\n\n결하고, 3.5Ω의 전구를 접속할 때, 전구에 흐르는 전류\n\n는 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n① 0.2          ② 0.4\n\n③ 0.6          ④ 0.8\n\n⑤ 1.2","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":944}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\nRLC직렬회로에서 공진곡선이 다음과 같이 나타날 때, 이\n\n회로의 양호도()를 나타내는 수식으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n                             \n①           ② \n\n                         \n③            ④     \n\n    ⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":973},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m12-e1.webp","width":696,"height":746}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n전력계통 연계시 나타나는 특징으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 공급 신뢰도가 향상된다.\n\n② 임피던스가 증가하여 단락전류가 작아진다.\n\n③ 한 계통의 사고가 연계된 다른 계통에 파급될 수 있다.\n\n④ 공급 예비력이 절감된다.\n\n⑤ 통신선 유도장해가 커진다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m13-q.webp","width":696,"height":387},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1136}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n다음과 같은 파형을 일컫는 말은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 반파여현대칭     ② 여현대칭\n\n③ 반파정현대칭     ④ 정현대칭\n\n⑤ 반파대칭","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":756},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":947}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n두 코일의 자기 인덕턴스가 각각 4mH , 9mH이고,\n\n상호 인덕턴스가 4.5mH 인 경우, 두 코일의 결합계수는?\n\n\n① 0.6          ② 0.7\n\n③ 0.75         ④ 0.8\n\n⑤ 0.9","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":484},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":935}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n2단자 임피던스 함수가      이다.       \n\n영점과 극점은?\n\n\n\n\n① 영점  : -3, -1,     극점  : 1, 4\n\n② 영점  : -3, 1,     극점  : 1, 4\n\n③ 영점  : -3, 1,     극점  : -4, 1\n\n④ 영점  : -1, 3,     극점  : -4, 1\n\n⑤ 영점  : -1, -3,     극점  : -1, -4","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m16-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":768}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 와  사이에 걸리는 전압 는\n\n몇 V인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 10          ② 12\n\n③ 14          ④ 16\n\n⑤ 18","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":822},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1114}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n2전력계법을 활용하여 3상 복소전력을 계산하려 한다.\n2개의 전력계 지시값이 각각 W, W\n\n라면, 복소전력은 몇 VA인가?\n\n①     ② \n③    ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":577},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":867}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\nΩ, Ω인 직렬회로에\nsin°sin°V를\n\n인가할 때, 회로의 소비전력W은?\n\n\n① 1220         ② 1110\n\n③ 1099         ④ 1088\n\n⑤ 1077","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m19-q.webp","width":696,"height":484},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1015}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n3상 불평형 전압에서 역상전압이 30V이고, 정상전압이\n\n120V, 영상전압이 10V라 할 때, 전압 불평형률은?\n\n\n① 5         ② 10\n\n③ 15        ④ 20\n\n⑤ 25","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m20-e1.webp","width":696,"height":359}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n외부 이상전압의 특징으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 외부이상전압과 내부이상전압의 파두장과 파미장은 모두\n\n  다르다.\n\n② 표준 충격 전압 파형은 × s이다.\n\n③ 뇌전압은 충격파이다.\n\n④ 154kV에서는 유도뢰에 의한 이상전압의 영향이 없다.\n\n⑤ 외부 이상전압의 파고는 낮지만 지속시간이 길다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":921}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n소도체의 반지름이 14mm, 소도체간의 거리가 70cm\n\n인 2복도체의 등가반지름은 약 몇 cm인가?\n\n\n① 3.5          ② 4.9\n\n③ 5           ④ 7\n\n⑤ 9.8","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m22-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":603}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n154kV 선로의 애자련에 대한 250mm 현수애자의\n\n개수는 몇 개가 적당한가?\n\n\n① 2~3         ② 4~6\n\n③ 10~11        ④ 19~20\n\n⑤ 40~42","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e06-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m23-q.webp","width":678,"height":315},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e06-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":588}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P047-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.08.03 한전 KPS (G4) (휴노) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n코로나를 방지하기 위한 방법으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 가선금구류를 개량한다.\n\n② 표면이 매끄러운 단선을 사용한다.\n\n③ 전선의 외경을 크게한다.\n\n④ 복도체를 사용한다.\n\n⑤ 코로나 임계전압을 작게한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.0